[{"id":179356021,"discussion_id":"5db91ffa286378d7a11a2cf9ee277e879b0a6569","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 对 `InitTensorSliceState` 函数进行了重构，新增了维度合并（coalesce）逻辑，以对齐 PyTorch 的 tensor 切分行为。主要思路是先根据原始 shape 计算 strides，然后依次执行\"剔除大小为 1 的维度\"和\"合并相邻连续维度\"两步 coalesce，最终将合并后的 `shape` 与 `strides` 写入 `TensorSliceState`，使得随机数算子的 tensor 分片方式与 PyTorch 保持一致。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **引入 coalesce 流程替代直接赋值**：原先直接从 `outputTensor` 读取各维大小填充 `state.shape` 和 `state.strides`，现改为先计算 `rawShape`/`rawStrides`，再通过 coalesce 得到 `coalescedShape`/`coalescedStrides`，最后才写入 `state`。\n- **剔除大小为 1 的维度**：遍历原始维度时跳过 `rawShape[dim] == 1` 的维度，将其从 coalesced 结果中移除，减少无效分片维度。\n- **合并相邻连续维度**：从后向前扫描 coalesced 后的维度，当 `coalescedShape[dim] * coalescedStrides[dim] == coalescedStrides[dim-1]` 时，将相邻两维合并为一维，压缩分片层级。\n- **处理标量 tensor 边界情况**：当 coalesce 后维度数为 0（即原始 tensor 为标量）时，设置 `coalescedShape[0]=1`、`coalescedStrides[0]=1`、`coalescedNdim=1`，保证 `state` 至少有一个有效维度。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-09T23:42:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-09T23:56:50+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179356022,"discussion_id":"533caad21c1e40fbbf79cc30cd73534f42c70ae3","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n本次变更在 `random/random_common/op_host/arch35/random_tiling_arch35.cpp` 的 `InitTensorSliceState` 函数中增加了 coalesce 逻辑，用于在切分前将 C-contiguous 张量维度合并（对齐 PyTorch 切分方式）。\n\n**逐文件审查结果：**\n- `random/random_common/op_host/arch35/random_tiling_arch35.cpp`：发现 1 个问题\n\n**按优先级统计：**\n- P0：0 个\n- P1：0 个  \n- P2：0 个\n- P3：1 个\n\n**总体风险判断：低。** coalesce 算法逻辑本身正确——通过去除大小为1的维度并合并相邻连续维度，将 C-contiguous 张量规约为单维表示，下游 `GetMaxOffsetBytes`、`GetDimToSplit`、`PartitionDim`、`ReduceDimExtent` 均能正确适配。唯一的理论风险是 coalesce 循环缺少 `MAX_TENSOR_DIMS` 边界检查，在实际场景中触发概率极低。\n\n> ⚠️ 已识别出整体风险，但无法提取行内评论，请参考整体评估。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-09T23:42:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-10T00:06:35+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179356030,"discussion_id":"5ba07ab21fc460464dc126b266dcadfd32c8626e","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n liangtongxue, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-09T23:42:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-09T23:42:15+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179356031,"discussion_id":"108fc226ff0688bbef95fb879cf6356a8a4690bf","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| repo-cann/ops-math | ✅ [*宋恺*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_) (2/2) | ✅ [*宋恺*](https://gitcode.com/songkai1